  - title: Collect
    body: Grab all three coins to win.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f0ac6f792648764c809b316da060ded, type: 3}
  - title: Stay safe
    body: 'The red block hurts. You have 3 hearts, and after a hit you blink and
      can''t be hurt for a moment.

      Escape or Start pauses.'
